  "plain": "Roswell is a town in New Mexico where, people say, a strange craft came down in 1947. A podcast host, Jesse Michels, passes on a rumor that Art Bell, a late-night radio host, ended up with some material that Michels thinks came from that crash. He raises it with the scientist Garry Nolan, and if the rumor were true, physical pieces of the Roswell object would have reached private hands."
